Function:
  - (coin-count)
  + (total-cost) :total-cost
Action:
  - apply-penalty-hundred:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 100))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 100) (increase (coin-count) 100))
  + apply-penalty-hundred:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 100))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 100) (increase (total-cost) 100))
  - apply-penalty-one:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 1))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 1) (increase (coin-count) 1))
  + apply-penalty-one:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 1))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 1) (increase (total-cost) 1))
  - apply-penalty-ten-thousand:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 10000))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 10000) (increase (coin-count) 10000))
  + apply-penalty-ten-thousand:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 10000))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 10000) (increase (total-cost) 10000))
  - apply-penalty-ten:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 10))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 10) (increase (coin-count) 10))
  + apply-penalty-ten:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 10))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 10) (increase (total-cost) 10))
  - apply-penalty-thousand:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 1000))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 1000) (increase (coin-count) 1000))
  + apply-penalty-thousand:
      pre: (and (>= (penalty) 1000))
      eff: (and (decrease (penalty) 1000) (increase (total-cost) 1000))
Init:
  - (= (coin-count) 0)
  + (= (total-cost) 0)
Metric:
  - (coin-count)
  + (total-cost)
Func prop:
  - (coin-count): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
Global prop:
  - action_cost_func:(coin-count)
  + action_cost_func:(total-cost)
